                                "sense_id": "2ed823ea-de81-3973-a9d2-7b0c57ccd1c5",
                                "text": "As in a garden, roves, of hues alone\nInquirent, curious?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61d7ef48-3fe2-4d96-b80f-996657781ec4",
                                "sense_id": "2ed823ea-de81-3973-a9d2-7b0c57ccd1c5",
                                "text": "Once a very inquirent disciple by the name of Chi Lu asked about […]"
